  "name": "Make web summaries and event cache reads linear",
  "slug": "make-web-summaries-and-event",
  "spec": {
    "summary": "Eliminate quadratic web blocker derivation and unrelated filesystem scans in the event cache fingerprint.",
    "details_md": "Precompute live reverse blockers once per web response snapshot and reuse them across list/tree/review/stale/detail summary conversion. Give FlatfileBackend event caching an event-only fingerprint that covers flat and sharded events without statting tickets or sessions.",
    "acceptance": [
      "Web summary DTO derivation computes reverse/live blockers once per response snapshot and preserves blocker semantics across summary endpoints and detail.",
      "Event cache fingerprinting reads only event paths while invalidating for flat and sharded event changes.",
      "Deterministic operation-count tests demonstrate linear summary work and no ticket/session stats on cached event reads."
